          "inputTemplate": {
            "zh": "依据上传的静态原稿制作 1 条海报动效视频。分析可安全运动的元素，提出方案供确认；用户指定时精细控制，否则由 Skill 规划，不要求逐层配置。保留构图、主体、文字、Logo 和信息层级，确认时长、画幅与声音后制作，结尾完整清晰定格。\n\n动态要求: {{motion_brief}}\n视觉呈现方式: {{visual_direction}}",
            "en": "Create 1 animated-poster video from the supplied artwork. Analyze safe motion opportunities and approve a plan. Use precise control when requested; otherwise let the Skill plan the motion without layer-by-layer intake. Preserve composition, identity, text, logos and hierarchy. Confirm duration, ratio and audio, then end on a complete readable freeze frame.\n\nMotion requirements: {{motion_brief}}\nVisual direction: {{visual_direction}}"
